      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of emptiness, which is a very heavy and isolating feeling. When the comforting narratives of purpose disappear, the silence can be deafening and terrifying. If you're feeling like nothing matters, please know that you don't have to carry this weight alone. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with support and help you navigate these difficult feelings.",
